# More lines for the reply sets a player hears most and that ran thin (chat audit CORPUS-C-048, 2026-11-18: farewell had
# 11 lines any bot could say, rez 6, abuse 6), and the reply sets the audit found missing: a ready check ("pull?"), a "who
# has / who is" question, a price check, how close a bot is to its level and a ding at 50. Every line fits ANY line of its
# set and promises nothing the server does not do. New writing (see docs/bot-voices/WRITING-GUIDE.md).

